{"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.066997264373904075,"h":0.023315663039876311,"w":0.12078083038330079,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.13038247445655932},{"t":"EMMA:","w":0.049397392272949231,"x":0.13125662457368531,"y":0.11980401705614918,"h":0.012146590528224088,"c":1},{"t":"JACK:","x":0.13157894663661651,"y":0.13662790684952963,"w":0.041353384653727204,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1},{"y":0.18475435728678069,"w":0.047763646443684887,"h":0.01111872980691353,"t":"EMMA:","x":0.13126406262913756,"c":1},{"y":0.21656976727311772,"w":0.03947368303934734,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","h":0.011627907148116678,"x":0.13157894769890849},{"t":"About seeds that lie in the ground for ages and only germinate after a fire?","h":0.017480233678185186,"y":0.12063953475232281,"c":1,"x":0.2124060212539437,"w":0.57330825805664065},{"y":0.13650998037976003,"h":0.017707662588538398,"x":0.21240601455869354,"c":1,"w":0.58646616617838543,"t":"That's the one. I knew a bit about it already, but not about this research. His."},{"c":1,"y":0.15236486563162455,"t":"analysis of figures comparing the times of the fires and the proportion of seeds that","x":0.21423360404251621,"h":0.018447618060778326,"w":0.63920415242513018},{"y":0.16866102274887473,"w":0.43271733601888018,"c":1,"x":0.2140926188381288,"h":0.018763973877188977,"t":"germinated was done in a lot of detail - very impressive."},{"w":0.59973683675130207,"c":1,"t":"Was that the article with the illustrations of early stages of plant development?","x":0.21421591267623,"y":0.18454094450418124,"h":0.018114089965820312},{"h":0.017958167592556418,"c":1,"t":"They were very clear.","y":0.20032259438496447,"w":0.16819426218668623,"x":0.21380716110395789},{"x":0.21223945224024143,"w":0.35370849609374999,"h":0.018254666349923232,"t":"I think those diagrams were in another article.","c":1,"y":0.21725961320444587},{"t":"EMMA:","y":0.25726744162943005,"w":0.046992479960123706,"h":0.011627907148116678,"c":1,"x":0.13157894744944945},{"h":0.011627907148116901,"c":1,"w":0.041353384653727232,"x":0.13157894667242032,"y":0.29069767430523274,"t":"JACK:"},{"t":"EMMA:","h":0.012055632228323176,"c":1,"y":0.33844892804848326,"w":0.047167065938313824,"x":0.13149165491033579},{"c":1,"w":0.041353384653727204,"h":0.011627907148116789,"t":"JACK:","x":0.1315789466299033,"y":0.370639534749585},{"t":"EMMA:","h":0.010174418447559619,"y":0.40406976749920953,"c":1,"x":0.13157894789979405,"w":0.046992479960123679},{"w":0.041353381474812823,"t":"JACK:","h":0.011627907148116678,"y":0.45203488357710442,"x":0.13157894822875904,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.13138507385942769,"y":0.48497969286982179,"t":"EMMA:","w":0.047380228042602529,"h":0.01259875374307029},{"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","y":0.50145348825410696,"w":0.041353384653727204,"x":0.13157894666645301},{"y":0.56686046515848765,"t":"EMMA:","h":0.010174418447559619,"x":0.13345864667053878,"w":0.045112781524658224,"c":1},{"w":0.041353381474812823,"t":"JACK:","x":0.13157894848565124,"y":0.59883720911974003,"c":1,"h":0.011627907148116789},{"x":0.21233213813879975,"y":0.25721884057299471,"t":"Anyway, shall we have a look at the procedure for our experiment? We'll need to","w":0.62045069376627615,"c":1,"h":0.01859117582852976},{"h":0.014614436830617583,"c":1,"t":"get going with it quite soon.","y":0.2746297490060039,"w":0.21428571065266935,"x":0.21428571598121507},{"x":0.21415983923574516,"y":0.28917902744175661,"t":"Right. So the first thing we have to do is find our seeds. I think vegetable seeds","h":0.019696418654128078,"c":1,"w":0.6092566935221353},{"x":0.21225943449399079,"y":0.30429766392815316,"t":"would be best. And obviously they mustn't all be the same size. So, how many.","w":0.60936365763346356,"h":0.021384315957427402,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.86278195554253068,"t":"Q26","y":0.31104651168249287,"h":0.014534883321060788,"w":0.033834584554036429},{"h":0.018088963441670769,"w":0.34807584126790359,"c":1,"y":0.32146583742268398,"x":0.21224229952274054,"t":"sorts do we need? About four different ones?"},{"h":0.02055892403940951,"t":"I think that would be enough. There'll be quite a large number of seeds for each","w":0.61498921712239585,"c":1,"x":0.21222750531707352,"y":0.33763688243169798},{"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.011627907148116789,"c":1,"t":"one.","x":0.21616541318772164,"y":0.35610465103834466},{"h":0.022453227046222324,"t":"Then, for each seed we need to find out how much it weighs, and also measure its Q27","y":0.36908601136576769,"x":0.21218565412553791,"c":1,"w":0.68650263468424466},{"t":"dimensions, and we need to keep a careful record of all that.","c":1,"y":0.38610393422627953,"h":0.01977652176993927,"x":0.21408930949602259,"w":0.46468088785807293},{"h":0.022084277288727971,"w":0.59821868896484376,"t":"That'll be quite time-consuming. And we also need to decide how deep we're","x":0.2121650550252257,"y":0.40196555635473996,"c":1},{"x":0.21213376075686408,"t":"going to plant the seeds - right on the surface, a few millimetres down, or several","y":0.4163272219835934,"h":0.026926960549044532,"c":1,"w":0.63210901896158855},{"x":0.21391874805820904,"y":0.43566053485645773,"t":"centimetres.","w":0.098586438496907569,"h":0.014502441199917393,"c":1},{"h":0.022984717787271625,"c":1,"x":0.21401617191836314,"y":0.45097139136832864,"t":"OK. So then we get planting. Do you think we can plant several seeds together in","w":0.63213465372721345},{"w":0.15789473215738933,"t":"the same plant pot?","x":0.21240601728483463,"y":0.46941403753912447,"h":0.013200257566001294,"c":1},{"x":0.21398797384350898,"w":0.38219736735026044,"h":0.020231273967990959,"c":1,"y":0.48279288914498464,"t":"No. I think we need a different one for each seed."},{"c":1,"x":0.21396616230789561,"y":0.49899832240540465,"h":0.025333893352835202,"t":"Right. And we'll need to label them - we can use different coloured labels. Then we","w":0.64346211751302085},{"h":0.030295760725209231,"t":"wait for the seeds to germinate - I reckon that'll be about three weeks, depending","x":0.21208243882585293,"y":0.51227171211696687,"c":1,"w":0.63238133748372394},{"y":0.53062297641249312,"w":0.60784286499023432,"x":0.21399370483728775,"t":"on what the weather's like. Then we see if our plants have come up, and write","h":0.026288341416594085,"c":1},{"t":"down how tall they ve grown.","y":0.54867751086620531,"w":0.22810442606608072,"h":0.017697979693096499,"c":1,"x":0.21211410802963437},{"h":0.027801055564315447,"t":"Then all we have to do is look at our numbers, and see if there's any relation","x":0.21385957019226262,"y":0.56236488437966181,"w":0.59296015421549475,"c":1},{"h":0.013200257566001183,"c":1,"t":"between them.","y":0.58274307765671862,"x":0.21428571669465291,"w":0.11466164906819659},{"t":"That's right. So ...","x":0.21428571244278263,"c":1,"w":0.1390977478027344,"h":0.014534883321060788,"y":0.59883720948951036},{"t":"SECTION 4","x":0.13345864805225957,"h":0.01905071175029327,"y":0.64810045101431379,"w":0.15413533528645831,"c":1},{"y":0.6764946606728055,"t":"Hi. Today we're going to be looking at animals in urban environments and I'm going to be","x":0.13305541884052616,"w":0.68881642659505204,"c":1,"h":0.030990809374905615},{"y":0.69361155744635195,"w":0.6249107360839844,"h":0.027518722524354389,"x":0.13121099550355042,"c":1,"t":"telling you about some research on how they're affected by these environments."},{"x":0.13311142189659808,"w":0.67741546630859373,"y":0.71805695036293726,"h":0.02952275273113647,"t":"Now, in evolutionary terms, urban environments represent huge upheavals, the sorts of","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.029543327041694711,"w":0.72064885457356753,"x":0.13313163634630362,"t":"massive changes that usually happen over millions of years. And we used to think that only a","y":0.73402864726510564},{"w":0.71886489868164061,"c":1,"t":"few species could adapt to this new environment. One species which is wellknown as being","x":0.13127154568090399,"y":0.74939681446577799,"h":0.031343606235285537},{"x":0.13307153820702297,"w":0.70201807657877602,"h":0.03136330363217732,"c":1,"t":"highly adaptable is the crow, and there've been various studies about how they manage to","y":0.76600888376259424},{"t":"learn new skills. Another successful species is the pigeon. because they're able to perch on.","x":0.13300904509897654,"w":0.71339238484700518,"h":0.031791021343361425,"y":0.78226517170719123,"c":1},{"t":"ledges on the walls of city buildings, just like they once perched on cliffs by the sea.","c":1,"y":0.79868822998929456,"h":0.030125956341902516,"x":0.13305281706475464,"w":0.64758178710937497},{"t":"But in fact, we're now finding that these early immigrants were just the start of a more general","c":1,"h":0.032349725884156855,"x":0.13490411830863347,"y":0.82209638445808209,"w":0.72269938151041668},{"w":0.72457183837890637,"t":"movement of animals into cities, and of adaptation by these animals to city life. And one thing.","c":1,"h":0.034078586968927294,"x":0.13314167826445242,"y":0.83777919027800851},{"y":0.85412742464781477,"c":1,"w":0.72081970214843749,"h":0.033697193388929736,"t":"that researchers are finding especially interesting is the speed with which they're doing this -","x":0.13307269305206679},{"h":0.030770500168367465,"y":0.87075318284620629,"t":"we're not talking about gradual evolution here - these animals are changing fast.","w":0.62498026529947914,"x":0.13313106796994162,"c":1},{"x":0.13307483317850946,"w":0.70397013346354176,"y":0.89324037276359425,"c":1,"h":0.03539908876437492,"t":"Let me tell you about some of the studies that have been carried out in this area. So, in the"},{"c":1,"t":"University of Minnesota, a biologist called Emilie Snell-Rood and her colleagues looked at","w":0.69647994995117191,"x":0.13489891278959401,"h":0.034168441143637707,"y":0.91000022531336644},{"w":0.70752690633138027,"t":"specimens of urbanised small mammals such as mice and gophers that had been collected","x":0.13317982384281682,"y":0.92873896920932986,"h":0.030496664839411158,"c":1},{"h":0.03237520919180803,"t":"in Minnesota, and that are now kept in museums there. And she looked at specimens that","c":1,"x":0.13123109310326905,"w":0.6982482401529948,"y":0.94378823284073221},{"y":0.98982558130813414,"x":0.1353383455436114,"h":0.0087209303610876754,"t":"100","c":1,"w":0.035714286168416348},{"y":0.76250000036582,"h":0.016048516140242053,"x":0.86375209370052664,"t":"Q31","c":1,"w":0.037727858225504618},{"w":0.03571428616841632,"h":0.015988371407532731,"c":1,"y":0.79360465134565228,"t":"Q32","x":0.86654135328797222}],"h":3106,"w":2400}